msgctxt "custom/003/RegSeaPvpGaro_00384:TEXT_REGSEAPVPGARO_00384_HOUSHI_003_004:1"
msgid "...Again, favored of the <if ($n1 == 19)>Golden Wolf<else><if ($n1 == 20)>Makai Fist<else><if ($n1 == 21)>Undying Twilight<else><if ($n1 == 22)>White Night<else><if ($n1 == 23)>Makai Bow<else><if ($n1 == 24)>Makai Sun<else><if ($n1 == 25)>Makai Moon<else><if ($n1 == 27)>Makai Vessel<else><if ($n1 == 28)>Makai Lore<else><if ($n1 == 30)>Silver Wolf<else><if ($n1 == 31)>Makai Arm<else><if ($n1 == 32)>Darkness<else><if ($n1 == 33)>Makai Star<else><if ($n1 == 34)>Makai Blade<else><if ($n1 == 35)>Makai Crimson<else><if ($n1 == 37)>Makai Guardian<else><if ($n1 == 38)>Makai Flicker<else><if ($n1 == 39)>Makai End<else><if ($n1 == 40)>Makai Mind</if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if></if>? I have already bestowed upon you a title befitting your resplendence. Go! Shower yourself in glory, and prove I was not wrong in my appraisal of your worth."
msgstr ""

